{"unit_id":"gaopengpian__dsh-custom-ui-theme#feature-1","repo":"gaopengpian/dsh-custom-ui-theme","commit":"5e82c3faa3f3da725f946f8462e39d38fd81c423","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-ui-theme 的功能「区域样式编辑」：用户可在预设界面区域分别设置背景色、边框颜色与宽度、圆角，以及文字颜色、字体、字号和字重；设置会生成覆盖对应元素的样式。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:585-660"]}
{"unit_id":"gaopengpian__dsh-custom-ui-theme#feature-2","repo":"gaopengpian/dsh-custom-ui-theme","commit":"5e82c3faa3f3da725f946f8462e39d38fd81c423","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-ui-theme 的功能「元素拾取与选择器绑定」：点击区域的选取按钮后可在页面点选目标元素，也可编辑 CSS 选择器；面板提供匹配预览，支持清除选择并恢复自动绑定。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:430-510"]}
{"unit_id":"gaopengpian__dsh-custom-ui-theme#feature-3","repo":"gaopengpian/dsh-custom-ui-theme","commit":"5e82c3faa3f3da725f946f8462e39d38fd81c423","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-ui-theme 的功能「全局主题令牌和字体」：全局区域可覆盖宿主的文本、背景、链接及品牌色令牌，并设置全局字体、字号和字重；字体选择器也可请求读取本机字体。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:250-320"]}
{"unit_id":"gaopengpian__dsh-custom-ui-theme#feature-4","repo":"gaopengpian/dsh-custom-ui-theme","commit":"5e82c3faa3f3da725f946f8462e39d38fd81c423","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-ui-theme 的功能「自定义区域与持久化」：用户可新增、重命名、删除自定义区域并关联页面元素；插件把设置写入浏览器 localStorage，提供全部重置入口。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:330-365"]}
